0,"endColumn":11,"endLine":136,"line":124},"type":51,"typeText":"∀ {a b : Nat},\n  Not (Dvd.dvd.{0} b (HAdd.hAdd.{0, 0, 0} a 1)) →\n    Eq.{1} (HDiv.hDiv.{0, 0, 0} (HAdd.hAdd.{0, 0, 0} a 1) b) (HDiv.hDiv.{0, 0, 0} a b)","unsafe":false,"value":422,"source":{"code":"theorem succ_div_of_not_dvd {a b : Nat} (h : ¬ b ∣ a + 1) :\n    (a + 1) / b = a / b := by\n  replace h := mt dvd_of_mod_eq_zero h\n  cases b with\n  | zero => simp\n  | succ b =>\n    rw [eq_comm, Nat.div_eq_iff (by simp)]\n    constructor\n    · rw [Nat.div_mul_self_eq_mod_sub_self]\n      omega\n    · rw [Nat.div_mul_self_eq_mod_sub_self]\n      have : (a + 1) % (b + 1) < b + 1 := Nat.mod_lt _ (by simp)\n      omega","start":124,"end":136},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}